  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2302.04 Fees",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2302.04 Fees.\n\n(a) Pursuant to RSA 270-E:5, each applicant shall pay the appropriate registration fees along with the registration application set forth in Saf-C 2302.03.\n\n(b) Pursuant to RSA 72-A:3 and RSA 72-A:4, each applicant shall pay the appropriate boat fee either prior to or at the time of registration.\n\n(c) Pursuant to RSA 270-E:6, vessels which are exempt from fees shall be registered in accordance with the provisions of Saf-C 2302.03.\n\n(d) Pursuant to RSA 72-A:4, for boats required to display a boat fee decal, the boat fee pursuant to RSA 72-A:2 may be paid separately, or together with the vessel registration.\n\n(e) All fees, except those pertaining to a commercial vessel registration, shall be paid at one of the locations set forth in Saf-C 2302.02(a).\n\n(f) All fees pertaining to a commercial vessel registration shall be paid at the division of motor vehicles, as set forth in Saf-C 2302.02(a)(1).\n\nSource. #5283, eff 11-22-91; ss by #6616, eff 10-25-97, EXPIRED: 10-25-05\n\nNew. #8506, INTERIM, eff 12-7-05, EXPIRES: 6-5-06; ss by #8617, eff 4-28-06, EXPIRED: 1-21-15 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 2300)\n\nNew. #10787, eff 2-20-15; ss by #14321, eff 7-16-25, EXPIRES: 7-16-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c2300.html"
